      {
        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Dub a Video into 5 Languages\n\n**Dub a Video into 5 Languages** localizes a talking-head clip into multiple languages with lip-synced audio.\n\n1. **ExtractAudio** and **AutomaticSpeechRecognition** transcribe the spoken track from **Source Video**.\n2. **ForEach** iterates through **Target Languages**; **Agent** adapts the transcript to match the original spoken syllable cadence.\n3. **TextToSpeech** and **LipSync** render a lip-matched video for each language and **Collect** returns the complete localized set."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": -220
        },
        "width": 740,
        "height": 180
      },
